<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1481127185"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1532050860"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="BIRTHDAY"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ReoNa"/><amll:meta key="album" value="unknown"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:36.040"><div begin="00:11.267" end="02:42.806"><p begin="00:11.267" end="00:14.153" itunes:key="L1">浅く眠った夜の終わりは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浅睡的夜晚最后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa ku ne mu 't ta yo ru no o wa ri wa</span></p><p begin="00:16.051" end="00:19.552" itunes:key="L2">砂細工の夢を見るんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我做了个仿佛砂砾做的梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su na za i ku no yu me wo mi ru n da</span></p><p begin="00:22.248" end="00:25.112" itunes:key="L3">ふって吹けば消えるまぼろし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好似吹一口气就会消散的幻觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu 't te fu ke ba ki e ru ma bo ro shi</span></p><p begin="00:27.110" end="00:30.585" itunes:key="L4">なんのために苦しめるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么我会感到痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n no ta me ni ku ru shi me ru no</span></p><p begin="00:33.132" end="00:35.867" itunes:key="L5">叶わなくて息絶えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为实现不了而窒息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na wa na ku te i ki ta e ta</span></p><p begin="00:35.892" end="00:38.538" itunes:key="L6">未来を避けて何処まで行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了避免那样的未来 该去到哪里呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo yo ke te do ko ma de i ko u</span></p><p begin="00:38.590" end="00:41.072" itunes:key="L7">明日が来るのは嫌だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿迎接明天的到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta ga ku ru no wa i ya da</span></p><p begin="00:41.157" end="00:43.996" itunes:key="L8">でもここで終わるのはもっと嫌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却更不愿就在这里结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo ko ko de o wa ru no wa mo 't to i ya</span></p><p begin="00:44.141" end="00:46.524" itunes:key="L9">わたしの今日は続くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的今天将会一直延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no kyo u wa tsu zu ku yo</span></p><p begin="00:46.851" end="00:49.789" itunes:key="L10">耳を塞いだって続くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使捂住耳朵也会一直延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi mi wo fu sa i da 't te tsu zu ku yo</span></p><p begin="00:50.058" end="00:52.240" itunes:key="L11">止まないノイズたちが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知休止的那些噪音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ma na i no i zu ta chi ga</span></p><p begin="00:52.334" end="00:54.289" itunes:key="L12">まだ消えるなとさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“还不能消失”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ma da ki e ru na 」 to sa</span></p><p begin="00:55.033" end="00:57.499" itunes:key="L13">生きていたくなどないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并不想活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te i ta ku na do na i yo</span></p><p begin="00:57.867" end="01:00.829" itunes:key="L14">でも死にたいわけじゃないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是也并不想死去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo shi ni ta i wa ke ja na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:01.011" end="01:03.187" itunes:key="L15">こんな痛みにも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是这样的痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na i ta mi ni mo</span></p><p begin="01:03.262" end="01:05.187" itunes:key="L16">理由を付けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也能找到理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri yu u wo tsu ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:06.496" end="01:08.604" itunes:key="L17">いつか笑うためと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了将来能够欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka wa ra u ta me to</span></p><p begin="01:08.784" end="01:10.687" itunes:key="L18">理由を付けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以此作为理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri yu u wo tsu ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:32.119" end="01:35.141" itunes:key="L19">明日の予定がまだあったから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为还有明天预定好要做的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta no yo te i ga ma da a 't ta ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:36.982" end="01:40.651" itunes:key="L20">小さな命を拾ったから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">捡回了一条无足轻重的小命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na i no chi wo hi ro 't ta ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:43.095" end="01:46.097" itunes:key="L21">罪も憎しみもその一つだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">罪恶与憎恨也是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi mo ni ku shi mi mo so no hi to tsu da</span></p><p begin="01:47.948" end="01:52.073" itunes:key="L22">わたしの中のサイレントノイズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心中寂静的噪音的其中之一</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no na ka no sa i re n to no i zu</span></p><p begin="01:54.051" end="01:56.672" itunes:key="L23">孤島みたいな部屋からは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从孤岛般的房间中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to u mi ta i na he ya ka ra wa</span></p><p begin="01:56.762" end="01:59.442" itunes:key="L24">溺れそうな海が見える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以看到沉溺般的海洋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo re so u na u mi ga mi e ru</span></p><p begin="01:59.542" end="02:01.874" itunes:key="L25">明日が来るのが怖いよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我害怕明天的到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta ga ku ru no ga ko wa i yo</span></p><p begin="02:02.118" end="02:04.924" itunes:key="L26">でも優しい声を聞きたいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我听到了温柔的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo ya sa shi i ko e wo ki ki ta i yo</span></p><p begin="02:04.997" end="02:07.478" itunes:key="L27">誰も悲しませないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“不要让任何人悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 da re mo ka na shi ma se na i de</span></p><p begin="02:07.720" end="02:10.715" itunes:key="L28">迷惑の一つも掛けずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要添任何麻烦”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me i wa ku no hi to tsu mo ka ke zu ni 」</span></p><p begin="02:10.924" end="02:13.134" itunes:key="L29">砂細工みたいには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那声音并没有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su na za i ku mi ta i ni wa</span></p><p begin="02:13.215" end="02:15.371" itunes:key="L30">なれませんでした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">变得像沙子一样缥缈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na re ma se n de shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:15.975" end="02:18.315" itunes:key="L31">わたしの今日は続くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的今天将会一直延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no kyo u wa tsu zu ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:18.712" end="02:21.718" itunes:key="L32">耳を塞いだって続くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使捂住耳朵也会一直延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi mi wo fu sa i da 't te tsu zu ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:21.907" end="02:24.068" itunes:key="L33">止まないノイズたちが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知休止的那些噪音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ma na i no i zu ta chi ga</span></p><p begin="02:24.179" end="02:26.542" itunes:key="L34">まだ消えるなとさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“还不能消失”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ma da ki e ru na 」 to sa</span></p><p begin="02:26.931" end="02:29.275" itunes:key="L35">生きていたくなどないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并不想活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te i ta ku na do na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:29.718" end="02:32.687" itunes:key="L36">でも死にたいわけじゃないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是也并不想死去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo shi ni ta i wa ke ja na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:32.892" end="02:35.050" itunes:key="L37">こんな痛みにも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是这样的痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na i ta mi ni mo</span></p><p begin="02:35.161" end="02:37.290" itunes:key="L38">理由を付けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也能找到理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri yu u wo tsu ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:38.393" end="02:40.471" itunes:key="L39">いつか笑うためと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了将来能够欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka wa ra u ta me to</span></p><p begin="02:40.604" end="02:42.806" itunes:key="L40">理由を付けたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri yu u wo tsu ke ta yo</span></p></div></body></tt>